    "names": [
      "native Stream write actual WriteWrap template has independent empty slots and no Shutdown fields",
      "native Stream write FileHandle WriteBuffer preserves ENOSYS attempted bytes live descriptor and trigger",
      "native Stream write immediate failure clears request before returned native pointer retires",
      "native Stream write async result keeps native request through live forwarded completion and Dispose",
      "native Stream write complete try-write bypasses absent request template and keeps original total",
      "native Stream write partial try-write forwards remaining vectors while counting attempted total",
      "native Stream write try failure has no request and explicit skip bypasses try-write",
      "native Stream write nonnull borrowed send handle bypasses try-write and preserves pointer identity",
      "native Stream write invalid buffer types throw intrinsic TypeError without updating result slots",
      "native Stream write invalid type uses intrinsic error and original observable code Set",
      "native Stream write error setter throw returns EBUSY zero result and preserves reason and uncleared error",
      "native Stream write false error Set permits continuation and clears the original error",
      "native Stream write ordinary init-hook throw preserves completed WriteWrap and DoWrite result",
      "native Stream write completion throw still disposes and custom listener uses shared actual reporter",
      "native Stream write absent native request uses actual instance template and completion suppresses disabled JS",
      "native Stream write unsigned attempted counter wraps and shared Int32 result truncates exactly",
      "native Stream write backing token transfers once and survives Dispose until native pointer retirement",
      "native Stream write JSMethod absent and closed receiver guards run before buffer argument CHECK",
      "native Stream write WriteBuffer publishes async result before releasing its local native pointer",
      "native Stream write accepted async request survives later error Set failure until its real completion"
